<title>FINLAND: Finnish October jobless rate 15.3 pct - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish October jobless rate 15.3 pct - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate rose to 15.3 pct in October from 15.1 percent in September and it fell 1.2 percentage points from October last year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>			 Oct 1996     Sept 1996	Oct 1995</p>
<p> Unemployed	   377,000	370,000	 409,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  15.3	   15.1	    16.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The above figures are not seasonally adjusted. Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the October unemployment rate rose to 17.3 percent from 16.7 percent in September.</p>
</text>
